        "wy": "Rejected on identity. Enlarged 12x three-panel comparison (reference | candidate | per-pixel difference) was inspected directly. The candidate drops two identity features that reference.png has:\n1. The left head antenna is gone: 24 outline pixels at x7-10, y3-8 are #25354A in the reference and fully transparent in the candidate. The candidate reads as a one-antenna robot.\n2. The right eye is gone: 12 accent pixels at x18-20, y14-17 are #F4DDA2 in the reference and repainted body teal #56B5BC in the candidate. The candidate reads as one-eyed.\nOnly 36 of 1024 pixels differ and no pixel was added, so every mechanical measurement still passes. Mirror-test about the sprite centre: the reference's head and face are symmetric, the candidate's are not."
